<title>RUSSIA: Russian April unemployment unchanged at 6.99 mln.</title>
<headline>Russian April unemployment unchanged at 6.99 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people unemployed in Russia was 6.99 million or 9.7 percent of the workforce at the end of April, after 6.99 million in March, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	 APR 97     MAR 97     APR 96</p>
<p>    number unemployed (mln)     6.99	 6.99	 6.55</p>
<p>    percentage of workforce     9.7*	 9.6	   N/A</p>
<p>    officially registered (mln) 2.53	 2.55	 2.77</p>
<p>NOTES - Figures for total unemployed are based on the methodology of the International Labour Organisation.</p>
<p>* The  Statistics Committee gave the same figure for unemploymnet in both April and March but gave a different percentage rate for the level in April</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
